  "content": "\n\n## Intro :\n\nLibrary Ferret 是一個庫模組，旨在為 JTorLeon Studios 的模組集中化管理共用程式碼。雖然它本身不會增加任何可見內容，但對於我們工作室其他模組的功能運作至關重要。\n\n原本這個模組包含物品與方塊，但在下一個版本中，僅會保留「金幣」物品的功能。不過，Library Ferret 未來有潛力作為其他系統的基礎，例如貨幣系統或自訂遊戲機制，為模組開發者提供多功能的工具包。\n\n即使您沒有使用 JTorLeon Studios 的其他模組，Library Ferret 仍可用於整合自訂功能或擴展您自己的專案（例如金幣系統）。\n\n## Mods requiring Library Ferret\n\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/better-village\"\n  title=\"Download Better Villages - Improve Minecraft Villages\"\n  target=\"_blank\"\n  rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n  <img alt=\"Better Villages - Enhance and Improve Minecraft Villages\"\n    src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/dGVX5JbJ/37fb0191b7d0da4db6440b5ceb705e3eea0e6e35_96.webp\" />\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/awesome-dungeon\"\n  title=\"Download Awesome Dungeon - Explore Epic Dungeons in Minecraft\"\n  target=\"_blank\"\n  rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n  <img alt=\"Awesome Dungeon - New Structures and Loot-Filled Dungeons\"\n    src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/ptzsjBKT/ab4804bc31f91f53a5ffadc52162f1ab4c967cb5_96.webp\" />\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/awesome-dungeon-the-end\"\n  title=\"Download Awesome Dungeon: End Edition - Custom End Dungeons\"\n  target=\"_blank\"\n  rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n  <img alt=\"Awesome Dungeon End Edition - Mysterious End Dungeons and Loot\"\n    src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/BzjQfCJW/e99cea660527b15662c828b33833a506e772ce3b_96.webp\" />\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/awesome-dungeon-nether\"\n  title=\"Download Awesome Dungeon: Nether Edition - Dangerous Nether Dungeons\"\n  target=\"_blank\"\n  rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n  <img\n    alt=\"Awesome Dungeon Nether Edition - Survive Deadly Nether Dungeons\"\n    src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/gW1httFP/2b963bb4be8659f1f3492100aa9c48066ab699f0_96.webp\" />\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/awesome-dungeon-edition-ocean\"\n  title=\"Download Awesome Dungeon: Ocean Edition - Underwater Dungeons Adventure\"\n  target=\"_blank\"\n  rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n  <img\n    alt=\"Awesome Dungeon Ocean Edition - Discover Submerged Dungeons and Treasures\"\n    src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/hn56Bq5n/0b21eff420e6c04c3820efebd77ab9bf2ee82d76_96.webp\" />\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/disable-new-world-creation-screen\"\n  title=\"Disable New World Creation Screen - Bring Back the Classic Minecraft World Menu\"\n  target=\"_blank\"\n  rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n  <img\n    alt=\"Disable New World Creation Screen - Bring Back the Classic Minecraft World Menu\"\n    src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/hpXiq9nb/6eb794a665a467ed7307803da1e26a1316f6a0e5_96.webp\" />\n</a>\n\n喜歡這個模組嗎？別錯過未來的更新！前往專案頁面點擊「追蹤」按鈕，以便在新內容發布時收到通知。💚🚀\n \n## Partners :\n\n本專案由 <a title=\"Get the best Minecraft server hosting with BisectHosting – Use code JTL for a discount!\" href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/jtl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">BisectHosting</a> 榮譽贊助。歡迎瀏覽他們的服務，以優質且可靠的體驗輕鬆託管您的專案。\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a title=\"Get the best Minecraft server hosting with BisectHosting – Use code JTL for a discount!\" \n href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/jtl\" \n target=\"_blank\" \n rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img \n  src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/789de297-fbf1-423b-aa14-990433cf8f58.webp\" \n  alt=\"BisectHosting - Use code JTL for a discount!\" \n  width=\"1168\" height=\"155\"/></a>\n</p>\n\n## Call to Action :\n\n有任何問題嗎？需要協助嗎？歡迎加入我們的 <a title=\"Join our Discord community for updates and support!\" href=\"https://jtorleon-studios-team.github.io/discord.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Discord</a> 社群，或前往 <a title=\"Report issues and contribute on GitHub!\" href=\"https://github.com/jtorleon-studios-team/libraryferret/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">GitHub</a> 回報問題並貢獻力量，一起參與模組開發！",
